<extref part="11" ref="schem_rtn_rtn_use_base_table"/>
</reference>


<source>WG3:W03-010 and WG3:W04-010
</source>


<problem>

<para>The table and the view use the column names ROUTINE_CATALOG, ROUTINE_SCHEMA, and
ROUTINE_NAME to refer to a specific name of a routine, but in other tables and views these
column names refer to (non-specific) routine names. 
That makes the column naming inconsistent and confusing,
both within this table and this view as well as relative to other related tables and views.
</para>

</problem>


<solution>

<para>The columns in ROUTINE_ROUTINE_USAGE ought to be renamed to a more consistent and
clearer naming scheme. 
Alternatively, if no renaming is desired, a note could be added to point out
the different meaning.
</para>

</solution>

</PP>



